  "key_insight": "Evaluation passed because final state matched ground truth despite redundant calls; however, adherence to delta2 and delta18 would eliminate unnecessary tool invocations and improve efficiency. The model correctly chained fillFuelTank→displayCarStatus in Turn 0 and set_navigation in Turn 2, demonstrating proper sequencing where it mattered."
